# The link farm capture.mjs assembles from the installed registry. Links to
# hundreds of megabytes of bundles; rebuilt from FIXTURES.json on every run.
.bundles/

# A fixture volume that may not be named in the repository, and its baseline.
# The public proof city takes the slot over when it has a bundle; see the
# city entry under pendingSlots in FIXTURES.json.
FIXTURES.private.json
private/

# Anything the harness renders rather than records. Baselines are JSON, and a
# raster the harness happened to draw is not a golden.
#
# ONE EXCEPTION, AND IT IS A GOLDEN. The screenshot steps compare the pane
# against a committed picture, because a build that drew every pin in the wrong
# colour passed everything else in this directory (SCHEMA.md §2.1.3). Those
# pictures are the gate, so they are committed -- and only those: the rule
# above still holds everywhere else, which is what keeps a stray render out.
*.png
!screens/**/*.png
*.jpg
*.webp
screenshots/
